ttps://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:15:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>古罗马的布鲁马利亚节</title><link>https://some.pics/6b092ab9159c4</link><description>&lt;p&gt;布鲁马利亚节 · 古罗马&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Watercolor-and-ink Roman courtyard feast with a terracotta amphora, two wine cups, scored round loaf, and burning clay oil lamp on a stone table beneath an arch framing a cloudy, star-filled night sky. Pale sage design with serif lettering and a gold emblem at bottom-right. Text: November 27, Brumalia, Ancient Rome. Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1440" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b092ab9159c4.jpg" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:01:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>顺应四季，品味当下</title><link>https://some.pics/6b08f272eed12</link><description>&lt;p&gt;“在每个季节里生活，随它流逝；呼吸空气，饮下饮品，品尝果实，并让自己顺应每个季节的影响。”
——亨利·戴维·梭罗，《日记》，1853年

致月亮在巨蟹座，亏凸月，太阳在射手座。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Portrait botanical watercolor-and-ink illustration on pale mauve, with an oval garland of apple blossoms, strawberries, blackberries, oak leaves, acorns, and ferns surrounding a dark serif quotation. A gold emblem watermark sits at bottom-right. Text: Live in each season as it passes; breathe the air, drink the drink, taste the fruit, and resign yourself to the influences of each. — Henry David Thoreau, Journal, 1853 Hello Miz Jeannie watermark." height="1440" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hellomizjeannie/6b08f272eed12.jpg" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hellomizjeannie.some.pics"&gt;@hellomizjeannie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:01:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>雪中花</title><link>https://some.pics/6b08ed0244031</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;花上的雪&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Snow-covered pink flowers in a hanging basket against a wooden post and brick wall." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/annie/6b08ed0244031.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://annie.some.pics"&gt;@annie&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:37:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>比赛日也有好时光</title><link>https://some.pics/6b08ba496bfe7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;这一天并不全是坏事——赛后赢得达阵的庆祝&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="3 chicago bears players are huddled together and very excited. #15, rome odunze, scored the touchdown and is yelling" height="1250" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/horror/6b08ba496bfe7.jpg" width="1250"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://horror.some.pics"&gt;@horror&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:01:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>牛膝草精油今日推荐</title><link>https://some.pics/6b08b9fd2a12f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;今日精油 — 牛膝草精油&l